{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:1811","original":"\"Ordinary Black Magician\" and second main protagonist of the [[Touhou]] series. The sole playable character of [[100th Black Market]], where her eye color changed from [[yellow eyes|yellow]] to [[red eyes|red]].\r\n\r\nMarisa flies by [[broom riding|riding]] a [[broom]] and fuels her magic with phantasmal [[mushroom]]s, which have given occasion to countless fanon jokes. Uses the [[Master Spark]] move when fighting, which she powers with her favorite artifact, the [[mini-hakkero]].\r\n\r\nShe has [[long hair|long]] [[blonde hair]] with a [[single braid|single]] [[side braid]] tied with a [[hair bow]]. Her outfit varies, but is usually some variation of a [[black hat|black]] [[witch hat]] with [[frilled hat|frills]], a [[buttons|buttoned]] [[black vest]] over a [[turtleneck shirt|turtleneck]] [[white shirt]] with [[puffy short sleeves]], a [[skirt set|matching]] [[frilled skirt|frilled]] [[black skirt]], a [[frilled apron|frilled]] [[white apron|white]] [[waist apron]], [[white socks]], and either [[black shoes|black]] [[mary janes]] or [[brown boots]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #6473872: Default\r\n* !post #4014106: Outfit guide (up to Wily Beast and Weakest Creature)\r\n* !post #3054376: [[Kirisame Marisa (PC-98)| PC-98]]\r\n* !post #6586873: [[Unfinished Dream of All Living Ghost]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Kirisame Marisa (pc-98)]]\r\n* [[Cho Marisa]]\r\n* [[Invincible Marisa]]\r\n* [[Kirisame Marisa (Seihou)]]\r\n* [[New Super Marisa Land]]\r\n* [[marisad (meme)]] \r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Touhou Wiki: Marisa Kirisame\":[http://en.touhouwiki.net/wiki/Marisa_Kirisame]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"kirisame_marisa"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:12242","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":12242},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:kirisame_marisa","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:41.689712+00:00","name":"kirisame_marisa","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945.raw","raw_sha256":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","role":"canonical_scope","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f"},{"association":"official embedded tag.wiki_page","evidence_id":"wiki:6103","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"wiki_tag_link","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":12242,"tag_key":{"kind":"tag","namespace":"danbooru.tag","value":"kirisame_marisa"},"wiki_id":6103,"wiki_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"6103"}},{"body_sha256":"540f993bc8d54595ff2711c998f41cb7bc2611c03c57fe555988914c6cdfe326","evidence_id":"wiki-cut:6103","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","live_body_sha256":"540f993bc8d54595ff2711c998f41cb7bc2611c03c57fe555988914c6cdfe326","live_other_names_sha256":"1798fb67de208c2bf2d0683a8dd39fb13adaee85f33814a843852164483d3911","live_updated_at":"2026-01-02T22:15:51.187-05:00","old_body_sha256":"540f993bc8d54595ff2711c998f41cb7bc2611c03c57fe555988914c6cdfe326","old_evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:1811","o